            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第三章 细胞的形态结构"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.833,
            0.056,
            0.86,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "37"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.232,
            0.127,
            0.766,
            0.151
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "实验 10 用荧光脂质进行细胞活体染色"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.171,
            0.256,
            0.194
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验目的】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.204,
            0.575,
            0.223
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "学习用荧光脂质进行细胞膜染色的原理与技术。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.235,
            0.256,
            0.257
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验原理】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.268,
            0.895,
            0.395
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "合成荧光脂质类似物是一类人工合成的、带有荧光基团标记的脂质类似物，可混合于质膜成分中，是研究膜脂动力学的有力工具。但是多种合成脂质分子中，只有小部分可用于细胞生物学研究，原因是这些合成类似物与对应的细胞天然成分相比，疏水性较差，易与细胞膜解离。此外，荧光脂质带有大量荧光基团，部分荧光基团可能影响其脂质结构原有的物理和生物学特性，导致进入细胞的荧光脂质分子与内源脂质分子的行为并非完全一致，因此，相关实验必须设定合适的对照。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.405,
            0.421,
            0.428
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.439,
            0.893,
            0.479
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 仪器与用具: 激光共聚焦显微镜、35mm 玻璃底培养皿、60mm 培养皿、螺口玻璃瓶 (聚四氟乙烯内衬)、分光光度计。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.482,
            0.368,
            0.5
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:HeLa 细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.503,
            0.892,
            0.543
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂: C6-NBD-SM, C6-NBD-Cer、C12-NBD-Cer、C6-NBD-PS、C5-BODIPY-Cer。以上荧光脂质分子的结构如图 3-3 所示。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.556,
            0.854,
            0.872
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.16,
                0.556,
                0.854,
                0.872
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_4_table_11.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>C6-NBD-SM<eq>\\begin{array}{c}CH_{3}(CH_{2})_{12}CH=C-CHOH \\\\ | \\\\ NH(CH_{2})_{5}-C-NH-CH-O-P-OCH_{2}CH_{2}N&#x27;(CH_{3})_{3} \\\\ | \\\\ NO_{2} \\end{array}</eq></td><td>C6-NBD-PS<eq>\\begin{array}{c}O \\\\ | \\\\ CH_{3}(CH_{2})_{14}C-O-CH_{2} \\\\ | \\\\ NH(CH_{2})_{5}-C-O-CH-O-P-OCH_{2}C-NH_{3} \\\\ | \\\\ NO_{2} \\end{array}</eq></td></tr><tr><td>C6-NBD-Cer<eq>\\begin{array}{c}CH_{3}(CH_{2})_{12}CH=C-CHOH \\\\ | \\\\ NH(CH_{2})_{5}-C-NH-CH-O-P-OCH_{2}CH_{2}N&#x27;(CH_{3})_{3} \\\\ | \\\\ NO_{2} \\end{array}</eq></td><td>C12-NBD-Cer<eq>\\begin{array}{c}CH_{3}(CH_{2})_{12}CH=C-CHOH \\\\ | \\\\ NH(CH_{2})_{11}-C-NH-CH-O-P-OCH_{2}CH_{2}N&#x27;(CH_{3})_{3} \\\\ | \\\\ NO_{2} \\end{array}</eq></td></tr><tr><td>C5-BODIPY-Cer<eq>\\begin{array}{c}CH_{3}(CH_{2})_{12}CH=C-CHOH \\\\ | \\\\ H_{3}C-N(B-N(CH_{2})_{4}-C-NH-CH-O-P-OCH_{2}CH_{2}N&#x27;(CH_{3})_{3} \\\\ | \\\\ H_{3}C \\end{array}</eq></td><td></td></tr></table>"
            },
            {
              "type": "table_caption",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.334,
                0.877,
