    {
      "page_idx": 5,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.056,
            0.189,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "38"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.441,
            0.056,
            0.607,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.091,
            0.917,
            0.129
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "DMEM 培养基、DMEM F-12、磷酸缓冲液（PBS）、连二亚硫酸钠、Brefeldin A（布雷菲德菌素 A）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.132,
            0.436,
            0.151
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "具体配制方法见各实验步骤。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.162,
            0.307,
            0.184
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.195,
            0.833,
            0.215
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(一) NBD 标记的不同脂质分子在成纤维细胞质膜中的动态检测"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.228,
            0.917,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "本实验通过跟踪嵌入到细胞质膜的荧光脂质分子的去向，研究不同脂质分子的分布及去向。荧光脂质去向的不同取决于脂质分子亲水头部的特性。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.27,
            0.373,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 荧光脂质溶液配制方法"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.292,
            0.918,
            0.374
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "将 C6-NBD-PS 溶解于氯仿，C6-NBD-SM 溶解于乙醇（1mg/ml）。氯仿溶液应保存于螺口玻璃瓶（聚四氟乙烯内衬），而乙醇原液可用玻璃或者塑料管保存。母液存于 -20℃。使用前真空抽干（先通氮气再经真空干燥），溶剂挥发干燥后的脂质分子加入 DMEM 培养基使其浓度为 4μmol/L。摇匀溶液并置于 4℃ 保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.376,
            0.211,
            0.393
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 步骤"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.398,
            0.917,
            0.436
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "35 \\mathrm{~mm}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的玻璃底培养皿中培养 2 份 HeLa 细胞 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\sim 2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 天, 至细胞达到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50 \\% \\sim 80 \\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 汇合率。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.44,
            0.572,
            0.457
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 用冰冷的 DMEM 洗涤 HeLa 细胞 2 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.461,
            0.917,
            0.5
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 细胞层中加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 含有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 \\mu \\mathrm{mol} / \\mathrm{L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C6-NBD-SM 或 C6-NBD-PS 的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " DMEM, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 孵育细胞 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.504,
            0.918,
            0.544
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 将其中 1 份样品用冰浴的 DMEM F-12 洗涤 2 次, 然后加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 冰浴的 DMEM F-12。共聚焦显微镜记录荧光图片 (图 3-4, “0min” 样品)。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.549,
            0.488,
            0.788
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.134,
                0.549,
                0.488,
                0.788
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_5_image_14.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.145,
                0.801,
                0.485,
                0.896
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图3-4 C6-NBD-PS和C6-NBD-SM标记的HeLa细胞在 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "4^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 处理 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "30\\mathrm{min}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " （0min）和在"
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "4^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 处理后在 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "37^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 孵育 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "30\\mathrm{min}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " （30min）的荧光共聚焦显微图像（Celis，2006）标尺 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "= 10\\mu \\mathrm{m}"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.511,
            0.55,
            0.918,
            0.611
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 另外 1 份样品用冰冷的 DMEM 洗涤 2 次, 然后加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 预热到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的 DMEM。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.512,
            0.616,
            0.918,
            0.656
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 条件下, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养箱中孵育细胞 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.554,
            0.66,
            0.917,
            0.678
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 室温下 DMEM F-12 洗涤细胞 2 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.512,
            0.682,
            0.918,
            0.722
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 加入 1ml DMEM F-12 并镜检观察 HeLa 细胞（图 3-4，“30min”样品）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.513,
            0.734,
            0.66,
            0.756
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【注意事项】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.511,
            0.768,
            0.921,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在低温条件下（2～4℃），C6-NBD-SM与C6-NBD-PS这两种荧光脂质分子都可通过脂质自发流动从培养基转运到细胞质膜外层中。提高温度可诱导ATP依赖的C6-NBD-PS脂双层翻转扩散（flip-flop）。在哺乳动物细胞中，脂质的能量依赖型双分子层"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 6,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.411,
            0.052,
            0.612,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第三章 细胞的形态结构"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.845,
            0.053,
            0.872,
            0.067
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "39"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.088,
            0.907,
            0.237
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "翻转扩散只存在于氨基磷脂类分子，如磷脂酰丝氨酸和磷脂酰乙醇胺中。翻转扩散可在低至7℃的条件下观察到。一旦内化，C6-NBD-PS可被自发运输到内膜系统，与C6-NBD-PS不同的是，C6-NBD-SM只停留在质膜外层并通过内吞作用内化。C6-NBD-SM可与C6-NBD标记的糖脂分子一起，用于研究恶性肿瘤细胞的极性脂质运输。由于DMEM F-12含有HEPES，所以在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "CO_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养箱外反应也可保持pH稳定。观察时应使用无酚红的DMEM F-12。类似地，荧光胆固醇类似物麦角固醇可用于跟踪细胞表面胆固醇的去向。"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.247,
            0.738,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（二）通过连二亚硫酸法测量 NBD 标记鞘磷脂的循环量"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.28,
            0.907,
            0.32
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "连二亚硫酸盐可漂白细胞外侧的 NBD，基于该原理，可对 NBD 标记的脂质结合到质膜上的量进行测定。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.323,
            0.426,
            0.342
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 检测荧光脂质在细胞中的分布"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.344,
            0.907,
            0.385
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "溶液:荧光脂质母液的配制方法如前文所述。连二亚硫酸钠母液为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\mathrm{mol} / \\mathrm{L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的水溶液（需新鲜配制），使用时用DMEM稀释（最终浓度:"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50\\mathrm{mmol} / \\mathrm{L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.387,
            0.226,
            0.405
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "步骤:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.407,
            0.909,
            0.447
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）在 35mm 的玻璃底培养皿中培养 3 份 HeLa 细胞，经过 1～2 天，至细胞长到 50%～80% 汇合率。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.45,
            0.504,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 用冰冷的 DMEM 洗涤细胞 2 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.471,
            0.818,
            0.491
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 加入含有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4\\mu \\mathrm{mol} / \\mathrm{L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C6-NBD-SM 的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " DMEM, 在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 反应 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.492,
            0.825,
            0.512
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）用冰冷的DMEM洗涤细胞2次，然后加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\mathrm{ml}37^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 预热的DMEM。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.514,
            0.55,
            0.533
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养箱中，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 孵育细胞 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.536,
            0.909,
            0.576
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（6）室温下用DMEMF-12洗涤其中一份样品2次，然后加入1ml DMEM F-12并在显微镜下观察（图3-5，“淬灭前”）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.579,
            0.567,
            0.598
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 室温下用 DMEM 洗另外两份样品 2 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.6,
            0.882,
            0.619
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 加入 1ml 溶解有 50mmol/L 连二亚硫酸钠的 DMEM 溶液，室温反应 1min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.621,
            0.912,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（9）室温下用DMEM F-12洗涤8中的其中一个样品2次，然后加入1ml DMEM F-12并在显微镜下观察（图3-5，“淬灭后”）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.664,
            0.618,
            0.683
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(10) 室温下，用 DMEM 洗涤最后 1 个样品 2 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.685,
            0.563,
            0.704
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(11) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养箱中, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 孵育细胞 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.706,
            0.564,
            0.726
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(12) 室温下用 DMEM F-12 洗涤细胞 2 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.728,
            0.886,
            0.748
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(13) 加入 1ml DMEM F-12 并在显微镜下观察（图 3-5，“淬灭+30min 示踪”）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 21,
